@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
top to bottom direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

title Youth Sports League — Conceptual Domain Model

class Club {
  name
  registrationStatus
}

class ClubRepresentative {
  name
  contactEmail
}

class ClubRegistration {
  submissionDate
  decisionStatus
}

class ExperienceEvidence {
  description
  reviewStatus
}

class Team {
  name
  ageGroup
  suspensionStatus
}

class Player {
  name
  dateOfBirth
}

class Competition {
  name
  ageEligibilityRule
}

class TeamEntry {
  submissionDate
  status
  eligibilityReviewStatus
}

class FixtureRequest {
  requestedStartTime
  requestedEndTime
  status
  unallocatedReason
}

class Fixture {
  startTime
  endTime
  status
  changeReason
  changeDecisionStatus
}

class Venue {
  name
  approvedCapacity
}

class VenueAllocation {
  startTime
  endTime
  status
  plannedOccupancy
}

class MatchOfficial {
  name
}

class OfficialAppointment {
  role
  status
}

class Result {
  homeScore
  awayScore
  status
  recordedAt
  recordedBy
}

ClubRepresentative "0..*" -- "1..*" Club : represents
ClubRepresentative "1" -- "0..*" ClubRegistration : submits
Club "1" -- "0..*" ClubRegistration : is subject of
ClubRegistration "1" -- "0..*" ExperienceEvidence : includes

Club "1" -- "0..*" Team : fields
Team "0..*" -- "0..*" Player : has members

Team "1" -- "0..*" TeamEntry : submits
Competition "1" -- "0..*" TeamEntry : receives

Competition "1" -- "0..*" FixtureRequest : receives
Team "1" -- "0..*" FixtureRequest : requests
FixtureRequest "0..1" -- "0..1" Fixture : leads to

Competition "1" -- "0..*" Fixture : contains
TeamEntry "1" -- "0..*" Fixture : participates as home entry in
TeamEntry "1" -- "0..*" Fixture : participates as away entry in

Fixture "1" -- "0..*" VenueAllocation : has
Venue "1" -- "0..*" VenueAllocation : is assigned through

Fixture "1" -- "0..*" OfficialAppointment : has
MatchOfficial "1" -- "0..*" OfficialAppointment : receives

Fixture "1" -- "0..1" Result : has current result

note bottom of TeamEntry
  A team has at most one entry
  in the same competition.

  Both fixture entries must be accepted,
  belong to that fixture's competition,
  and represent different teams.

  Player age eligibility requires
  competition-specific assessment.
end note

note bottom of VenueAllocation
  Status distinguishes provisional,
  confirmed and released allocations.

  A confirmed fixture has exactly
  one confirmed venue allocation.

  Confirmed allocations at the same
  venue must not overlap. (FR03)

  Planned occupancy must not exceed
  approved capacity. (BR01)
end note

note bottom of ClubRegistration
  Acceptance requires reviewed
  prior-experience evidence. (BR03)
end note

note bottom of Fixture
  A suspended team cannot obtain
  a new fixture booking. (BR04)

  Postponements and cancellations retain
  a reason and decision status. (FR05)
end note

note bottom of Result
  Status distinguishes an outcome
  awaiting review from a final result.

  recordedBy identifies the staff member
  responsible for the recorded result.
end note

@enduml